            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Widwokan ka wiwaco ran ni, “Watieko timo reco kwoŋ Rwoth! Walakadho malo lweny paka Rwoth Were mawan omiyo wan or.” Ameno wijoje witwere ma lweny, ka wiparo nike labedo mayot kadho malo monjo piny matendere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ran ni, “Waci rijo jokiri jowokadhi malo lweny, kole angoye i dier win; ka k'obedo ameno jokwor mewin jolakikengila win.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awaco riwin, to wikinyalo winjo. Wigwenyere kwoŋ or pa Rwoth aka wikadho malo i piny matendere gi mbaka mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joamor m'oyido jobedo i piny matendere jowok monjo win aka joriemo win paka kic timo. Jogoyo win kiri piny i Edom tundo kiri i Horima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo wigik to wiywak ruwaŋ Rwoth, Rwoth k'owinjo dwondi win kosa k'odewo be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oro ma bedo i thim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
